libaldor source tree
===================

This directory contains the source of the base Aldor library.  The former
[g]make targets in this directory were retired in modernization v0.02.

Build the library through the supported recursive build system.  Normally,
from the distribution root:

    bash build.sh build

After the Aldor compiler and its prerequisites have already been built, the
library may be rebuilt directly with:

    (cd lib/aldor && bash build.sh build)

Build products are placed under ALDORROOT; they are not built in this source
directory.  Use the top-level `bash build.sh test` command for the supported
distribution test sequence.
